cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use FairLendKit, cite this software and pin the exact version or commit."
title: "FairLendKit"
type: software
version: "0.1.0.dev0"
authors:
  - family-names: "Ye"
    given-names: "Zijing"
    alias: "leafjing"
repository-code: "https://github.com/leafjing/fairlendkit"
url: "https://github.com/leafjing/fairlendkit"
license: Apache-2.0
abstract: >-
  FairLendKit is a reproducible fair-lending audit toolkit for credit
  decisioning systems. It produces review-ready group metrics, reliability
  states, uncertainty intervals, screening flags, and canonical audit records.
keywords:
  - fair lending
  - credit decisioning
  - responsible AI
  - model risk
  - fairness metrics
  - algorithmic auditing
  - reproducible research
